# A troll warlock (WoW: Forever's pairs, mod-allied-races) in the Valley of Trials: Forever's troll
# racials (Regeneration's 20%, no Da Voodoo Shuffle), and Mai'ah, the mage trainer, training them as a
# warlock trainer does.
cmd .list auras
has Hspell:20555|
expect-not Hspell:58943|
cmd .modify money 1000
go 1 -623.6 -4208.4 38.3
talk 5884
select 5884 train
has trainer type 0
has trainer spell 688 state 0
expect-not trainer spell 1459 state
train 5884 688
expect trained 688
